          "docs": "Returns all supported trading pairs available for the Convert feature.\nEach pair includes the source and target currency, amount limits, and decimal precision.\n\n---\n\n## Additional Info\n\n**Rate Limit** [📖 Learn More](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#api-limit-introduction)\n\nWeight: 1\n\n**Use Cases** [🧩 SDK](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#sdk)\n\n- **Pre-conversion Validation** — Check if a desired currency pair is supported before requesting a quote\n- **Limit Discovery** — "
        },
