          "docs": "Accept a previously fetched conversion quote using its `quoteId`. The conversion\nis executed immediately upon acceptance.\n\n**Key Notes**\n\n- The `type` parameter, if provided, must match the type used in the Get Quote request.\n- Quotes expire after the number of seconds indicated by the `expiry` field in the quote response.\n\n---\n\n## Additional Info\n\n**Rate Limit** [📖 Learn More](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#api-limit-introduction)\n\nWeight: 1\n\n**Use Cases** [🧩 SDK](https://api.doc"
