          "docs": "Query the history of convert orders for the authenticated account.\n\n**Key Notes**\n\n- Maximum query window is 180 days.\n- Default page size is 10; maximum is 200 records per page.\n\n---\n\n## Additional Info\n\n**Rate Limit** [📖 Learn More](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#api-limit-introduction)\n\nWeight: 1\n\n**Use Cases** [🧩 SDK](https://api.docs.coins.ph/reference/general#sdk)\n\n- **Conversion Audit** — Review all past conversions for a given time period\n- **Reconciliation** — Match conve"
